    <!-- Replaces Compose's own string of this name, whose Portuguese and German read as closing a spreadsheet. TalkBack's label for the dimmed area behind a bottom sheet, which closes the sheet. "Sheet" means a panel that slides up from the bottom of the screen, not a spreadsheet or a sheet of paper. -->
